# DESK18 run D -- the *Default dir* radio group end to end.
#   Options title centre (196, 8); drop-down box at x=160, entry n at
#   y = 27 + 16n (DESK05). "Desktop configuration..." is entry 7 -> (200,139),
#   "Save desktop..." entry 11 -> (200,203).
#   Dialog click points from the conf-probe dump (method/desk18_patch.py):
#     ADDESKCF ROOT (164,89) 312x320
#     DCDEFAPP abs (292,137) 96x16 -> click (340,145)
#     DCDEFWIN abs (396,137) 72x16 -> click (432,145)
#     DCOK     abs (220,377) 72x16 -> click (256,385)
# The card is method/DESK18A.INF, i.e. `#E` byte 5 = 60 -> *Application*.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 460
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 196 8
2200 mark B_OPTIONS
2500 move 200 139
2700 down
2703 up
2900 move 600 460
4200 mark C_CONF_APP
4500 move 432 145
4700 down
4703 up
4900 move 600 460
5600 mark D_CONF_WIN
5900 move 256 385
6100 down
6103 up
6300 move 600 460
7200 mark E_BACK
7500 move 196 8
8200 mark F_OPTIONS2
8500 move 200 203
8700 down
8703 up
8900 move 600 460
10000 mark G_SAVED
